+Linux authority and FD-capability prototype
+============================================
+
+This directory contains reconstructed engineering notes for the experimental
+Linux authority / file-descriptor capability prototype in this worktree. They
+are not upstream kernel documentation, a security certification, or a claim of
+complete mediation.
+
+.. warning::
+
+   The original reports were stored under ``/tmp`` and were lost after a
+   reboot. These files were recreated from the surviving conversation summary
+   and the current worktree. The CREATE report is reconstructed in detail from
+   the retained test/build summary. The DAC report is a synthesis of retained
+   audit findings plus current source review. The historical CVE report keeps
+   approximate IDs/classifications supplied in the surviving design history,
